<title>HUNGARY: Hungary to announce Mezobank tender by July 31.</title>
<headline>Hungary to announce Mezobank tender by July 31.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's privatisation agency APV Rt will announce a tender for the privatisation and a capital increase in Mezobank Rt to run until July 31, the government said in a statement.</p>
<p>State privatisation agency APV said on Wednesday that it would invite three foreign investors to a one-round closed tender for the sale of a 83.66 percent stake in Mezobank, a medium-sized bank, pending the government's approval on Thursday.</p>
<p>APV said it would invite two Austrian banks to the tender and also a bank from an English-speaking country, but gave no names.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
